{"id":"z02-32","volume":2,"volumeTitle":"周纪二","volumeSubtitle":"前329","index":32,"title":{"t":"顯王四十年","s":"显王四十年"},"book":{"t":"資治通鑑","s":"资治通鉴"},"sourceHead":{"t":"周紀二 · 前329 · 壬辰","s":"周纪二 · 前329 · 壬辰"},"author":"司马光","annotated":true,"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"tr":"秦国攻打魏国，渡过黄河，夺取汾阴、皮氏，又把焦攻了下来。","tokens":[{"t":"秦","s":"秦","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"伐","s":"伐","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"魏","s":"魏","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"渡","s":"渡","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"河","s":"河","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"取","s":"取","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"汾","s":"汾","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"陰","s":"阴","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"皮","s":"皮","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"氏","s":"氏","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"拔","s":"拔","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"焦","s":"焦","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]},{"sentences":[{"tr":"楚威王去世，他的儿子怀王槐继位。","tokens":[{"t":"楚","s":"楚","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"威","s":"威","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"王","s":"王","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"薨","s":"薨","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"子","s":"子","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"懷","s":"怀","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"王","s":"王","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"槐","s":"槐","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"立","s":"立","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]},{"sentences":[{"tr":"宋公剔成的弟弟偃突然发兵，袭击剔成。","tokens":[{"t":"宋","s":"宋","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"公","s":"公","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"剔","s":"剔","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"成","s":"成","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"之","s":"之","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"弟","s":"弟","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"偃","s":"偃","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"襲","s":"袭","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"攻","s":"攻","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"剔","s":"剔","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"成","s":"成","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"剔成逃往齐国，偃自己立为国君。","tokens":[{"t":"剔","s":"剔","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"成","s":"成","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"奔","s":"奔","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"齊","s":"齐","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"偃","s":"偃","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"自","s":"自","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"立","s":"立","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"爲","s":"为","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"君","s":"君","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]}],"lesson":{"background":"这一年是周显王四十年，公元前329年。秦军渡过黄河，从魏国手里拿走汾阴、皮氏，又攻下焦。楚国换了国君，威王去世，儿子怀王槐继位。宋国内部也变了：国君剔成的弟弟偃突然袭击，剔成逃到齐国，偃自己做了君。东方的君位和西方的城池在同一年里换手。","theme":"一年里叠着三件事。秦国已经从围城进到渡河取地，魏国黄河边上的汾阴、皮氏、焦都失了。楚威王去世，儿子怀王槐在这一年继位。宋国则是弟弟夺位，剔成出奔，偃自立。地盘和君位一起在动，没有哪一国还停在原地。","technique":"仍是短编年。写秦军的一句连用渡、取、拔，把过河、占城的次序压在一句话里。楚国用薨和立交代父子相传，宋国用奔和自立对照兄弟夺位。过程都不展开，也没有对话和臣光曰。","keyContentWords":[{"word":"汾阴","reading":"fén yīn","note":"黄河边上的魏地，这一年被秦军渡过河以后夺取。"},{"word":"皮氏","reading":"pí shì","note":"魏地城邑，和汾阴一起被秦军拿走。"},{"word":"怀王","reading":"huái wáng","note":"楚威王的儿子，名槐，这一年继位。"}],"keyFunctionWords":[{"word":"之","reading":"zhī","note":"宋公剔成之弟的之相当于的，连接国君和他的弟弟。"}],"ancientModern":[{"word":"拔","reading":"bá","note":"拔焦是把城攻下来，不是把东西拔出来。"},{"word":"薨","reading":"hōng","note":"楚威王去世。诸侯死称薨，不是山崩。"},{"word":"奔","reading":"bēn","note":"剔成奔齐是逃往齐国，不是往喜庆的事上赶。"}],"phoneticLoans":[],"flexibleUsage":[],"specialSyntax":[{"name":"承前省略","note":"取汾阴、皮氏，拔焦的主语都是前面的秦，后面不再重复国名。"}]}}
